OL,3,GNEWSANurse helped biker who felt fine
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn off-duty nurse managed to help a
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist who thought he was
OL,8,Funscathed after falling off his
OL,9,Fmotorbike.
OL,11,FElise Le Breton was having lunch in St
OL,12,FPeter Port last month when she saw Tim
OL,13,FBooth collapse on a nearby counter.
OL,15,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Guernsey, she
OL,16,Fsaid she "jumped up and went over to
OL,17,Fhim," calling for an ambulance and
OL,18,Fensuring Booth went to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
