OL,3,GNEWSANurse helped biker who felt fine
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was only later the motorcyclist
OL,7,Flearned "a pint of blood" had built up
OL,8,Fin his leg, having fallen off his bike
OL,9,Fthat morning.
